<title>SWITZERLAND: Oerlikon sees significant rise in profit.</title>
<headline>Oerlikon sees significant rise in profit.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss technology and consumer goods group Oerlikon-Buehrle Holding AG said it expected operating and net profit for the full year to show a significant improvement from 1995.</p>
</text>
